{"des":"霜烬平原的怪异调查-神秘的脚印互动","script":"s_5_6_3","exps":[{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_1"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这是什么……哇！是脚印！真的是脚印！看来附近真的有大脚雪怪！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_2"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0.4,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_3"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]呃……这看起来确实很像脚印耶。难道那什么脚什么怪的，真的存在吗？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_4"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]不只是这里……周围似乎还有许多类似的脚印。[l][cm]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_5"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这就是大脚雪怪存在的证据啊！它们昼伏夜出，总是在人们看不见的地方捕食猎物！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_6"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]他们拥有着比角猪更强壮的力量、比哈比更快的速度、比乌尔勒院长还要精明的头脑——[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_7"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]你怎么还直接幻想起来了……不继续调查一下吗？只有见到那雪怪的真身才能判断它的具体情况吧。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_8"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]不过说来也奇怪，这附近虽然脚印很多，却杂乱无章，完全不像是正常行走留下的痕迹。[l][cm]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_9"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这有什么奇怪的……奇异生物的行事方式自然也是奇异的，我们无法理解也很正常。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_10"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]而且这些脚印也不是毫无规律的，比如这里……呜啊！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_11"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]——噗嘎！[l][cm]","charaName":"芙洛波"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_12"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]（一只芙洛波突然从雪堆中跳出来，然后朝着远方逃跑了。）[l][cm]","charaName":""}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_13"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]吓死我了……怎么这附近还藏着芙洛波啊？！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_14"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]等等！你们看看那个芙洛波留下的痕迹，像不像大脚雪怪的脚印？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_15"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]嗯？你这么一说……好像还真有点像……[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_16"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]不过……这应该只是特例！这么多雪怪的脚印呢，难道都是芙洛波留下的？一定只是巧合而已！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_17"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]——你们是谁？在这里做什么？[l][cm]","charaName":"？？？"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_18"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]咦？你是什么人？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_19"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]我是附近温泉村的库皮，兼职院卫，听到这里有动静就过来看看。那么……能告诉我你们在这里做什么吗？[l]","charaName":"货殖系学生库皮"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_20"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_21","text":"（解释来到这里的原因。）"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_21"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]哈，原来如此，我还担心你们是佣兵在这里策划什么阴谋呢，原来只是为了这个。[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生库皮"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_22"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]我从来没听说过什么大脚雪怪，你们说的这些脚印，应该都是芙洛波留下的。[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生库皮"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_23"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]啊？不、不会吧？！它们为啥在这儿扎堆啊？！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_24"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]因为芙洛波也爱泡温泉啊。这附近有不少温泉坑，芙洛波们在这聚集再正常不过了。[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生库皮"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_25"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]许多芙洛波都会来这里泡温泉，一泡就是好几个小时。刚从温暖的温泉中出来，立刻被冰雪包围，这种冷热交替之下很容易出现一些反应的。[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生库皮"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_26"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]也就是说，它们泡温泉泡晕了。总之，这种坏习惯会让芙洛波走到一个地方躺很久，醒来后就会立刻跑掉。留下的痕迹就是你们看到的“脚印”了。[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生库皮"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_27"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]什么？！这么说我们又是白跑一趟了？那个在大书院里传得沸沸扬扬的大脚雪怪居然只是一群泡澡泡晕的芙洛波？[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_28"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]虽然可能会打击到你们，但这确实是事实，这些\"脚印\"确实是芙洛波造成的。如果真有大脚雪怪，我们这些住在温泉村的人早就该知道了。[l][cm]","charaName":"货殖系学生库皮"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_29"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]又……又是一个毫无根据的传说！可恶……连续三个传言都是假的，现在只剩最后一个了。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_30"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1h","layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]别……别放弃啦，不是还有最后一个吗？说不定就成功！说说最后一个传说吧！[l][cm]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_31"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]最后一个传说是“永眠洞窟的燃烧军团”，我们直接前往火龙山径的永眠洞窟一探究竟吧！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_32"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]哎等等！别急啊！{myName}，我们快追上他！[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_33"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]三位慢走！有空常来温泉村坐坐哦！[l][cm][hide]","charaName":"货殖系学生库皮"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_34"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1h","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[hide]","charaName":""}},{"key":"end","para":{"end":true}}]}